1. Issue: Agent responded only when user said “Why is my claim denied?” but failed for “explain my denial reason” or “what happened to my claim?”
Expanded expectedInput to include and also Also added fuzzy keyword triggers using regex match.

2.Issue: User asked about denied invoice with no remittance → assistant didn’t know which to respond to.

Fix:
Combined logic in Flow to evaluate:
Denial Code present?
Remit found?

3.Issue: User-facing Date of Service field failed when formatted as Text, needed Date.

Fix:
Converted input field to Data Type: Date in both Flow input and screen.

4.Issue: Agent says “not authorized” or topic doesn’t show up for internal users.

Root Cause: Agent Action is permission-restricted or not linked to the right Agent Configuration.
Fix:
Permission Set Access to use Agent Action.





